      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_01",
      "hash64": "4DD04D4773929EBA",
      "text": "今天有什麼事嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_01",
      "hash64": "B1EB6702BB84D9F7",
      "text": "我要參加藍莓聯盟！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_select_02",
      "hash64": "B1EB6802BB84DBAA",
      "text": "什麼事也沒有……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_02",
      "hash64": "4DD04C4773929D07",
      "text": "很抱歉，[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n目前是在藍莓學園留學，\\r\\n似乎不是這裡的正式學生……？",
