    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_reception_04",
      "hash64": "4DD04A47739299A1",
      "text": "既然冠軍都這麼說了，\\n請稍等一下！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "556F24944351BBF4",
      "text": "你竟然會來相助，\\n真是意外啊～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_03",
      "hash64": "DDAF5E5FD7DF3629",
      "text": "……你好像鬼鬼祟祟地\\n在背地裡操控著些什麼。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_brother_04",
      "hash64": "DDAF5F5FD7DF37DC",
      "text": "但是能和[VAR 0x0100(0000)]對戰的話，\\n對我來說也是求之不得。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
