      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_01",
      "hash64": "EFBFD84C5DEE9A37",
      "text": "阿栗！你怎麼對[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她\\n那樣說話……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
