      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_sister_04",
      "hash64": "EFBFD34C5DEE91B8",
      "text": "我也是很久沒和他說到話了，\\n剛才那感覺真～是差勁……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0130_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "556F22944351B88E",
      "text": "他貴為冠軍，\\n當然是高高在上囉～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
